<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L2_3_4" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L2_3_4">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L2_3_4" name="3.4 Metallurgical Accounting &amp; Quality (L2)" processRef="Process_L2_3_4"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L2_3_4" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L2/L3 Process Area. Systematic collection of representative samples, chemical analysis, and mass balance closure across the plant. Metallurgical accounting is the mechanism by which all mass flows, grades, and recoveries are reconciled to verify and report plant performance. This process area is governed end-to-end by AMIRA P754 and all 10 of its principles apply within it.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L2_3_4">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_4_smp" name="Plant Chemist / Process Technician">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L2_3_4_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_4_asy" name="Laboratory Analyst / Process Metallurgist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_4_acc" name="Chief Metallurgist / Metallurgical Accounting Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L2_3_4_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L2_3_4_s" name="Shift start; auto-samplers active">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_4_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1" name="3.4.1 Sampling">
      <bpmn:documentation>L1/L3 Process. Representative sampling of all plant streams at defined measurement points is the foundation of metallurgical accounting. AMIRA P754 Principle 6 (representative, unbiased sampling) is the governing constraint. Automatic samplers on continuous streams; grab/composite sampling for batch and periodic streams.
ISA-95 level: 1–3
Actors: Plant Chemist; Process Technician
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 3; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 6, 7, 10
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (sample_submission)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_4_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_4_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2" name="3.4.2 Assay &amp; Analysis">
      <bpmn:documentation>L1/L3 Process. Chemical analysis of prepared samples determines the grade (metal content) of each process stream. Two parallel analytical channels exist: (1) the primary laboratory (fire assay for Au, ICP-OES/MS or XRF for base metals) for shift composite, daily composite, and concentrate product samples; (2) on-stream analysis (OSA) using online XRF analyzers for real-time process control.
ISA-95 level: 1–3
Actors: Laboratory Analyst; Process Metallurgist; LIMS
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 1, 3; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (assay_result, osa_grade_record)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_4_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_4_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3" name="3.4.3 Mass Balance &amp; Reconciliation">
      <bpmn:documentation>L3 Process Area. Periodic mass balance closure integrates all mass flow measurements (belt weighers, flowmeters, density gauges) and grade measurements (lab assay, OSA) to compute metal produced, metal recovered, metal lost (to tailings), and metal unaccounted for. This is the core deliverable of AMIRA P754 compliance and the primary source of reconciliation data for mine-to-mill and mill-to-port reporting.
ISA-95 level: 3
Actors: Chief Metallurgist; Metallurgical Accounting Analyst; Plant Manager
Standard alignment: AMIRA P754 (all 10 principles); ISA-95 Level 3
DDVC layer: Curated (shift_mass_balance, metallurgical_accounting_report)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_4_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_4_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L2_3_4_e" name="Monthly metal accounting report filed">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_4_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_4_1" sourceRef="Start_L2_3_4_s" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_4_2" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_4_3" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_4_4" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3" targetRef="End_L2_3_4_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L2_3_4">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L2_3_4" bpmnElement="Collab_L2_3_4">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L2_3_4_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L2_3_4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="916" height="510"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_4_smp_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_4_smp" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="876" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_4_asy_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_4_asy" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="876" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_4_acc_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_4_acc" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="360" width="876" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L2_3_4_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L2_3_4_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="139" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_1" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_2" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="227" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_4_3_4_3" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="397" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L2_3_4_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L2_3_4_e"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="417" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="798" y="479" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_4_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_4_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_4_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="596" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_4_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_4_4"><di:waypoint x="784" y="445"/><di:waypoint x="820" y="445"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
